          "file": "games/arkhamhorror/tests/fhv-investigator-10004.test.mjs",
          "test": "P5 10004 强制离场归还：带线索支援离场时线索放到所在地点"
        },
        {
          "file": "games/arkhamhorror/tests/fhv-investigator-10004.test.mjs",
          "test": "P5 10004 强制翻面：线索放到稳定器后检索以太电流洗入牌库，翻至开启面并保留标记/附属"
        },
        {
          "file": "games/arkhamhorror/tests/fhv-investigator-10004.test.mjs",
          "test": "P5 10004 旧印：+0 且把 1 个线索从支援移回凯特"
        },
        {
          "file": "games/arkhamhorror/tests/fhv-investigator-10004.test.mjs",
